ANK YOU! We are with you. \n\n#DefundThePolice #BlackLivesMatter \n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/OcCA8LnsPm","media":null,"username":"g_ray1947","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1272512140058951681","date":1592225510000,"rawContent":"I'm very confused how any police officer can feel their life is in \"imminent danger\" when the person is running away. #RayshardBrooks #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"g_ray1947","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1272516729663561728","date":1592226605000,"rawContent":"We need to take to the streets, too, when women are sexually assaulted. Can you imagine a world wherein we vigorously protested for people like Oluwatoyin Salau? I can. SHOUT her name! #BlackLivesMatter #MeToo @OffMuteRKelly  \n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/8wLRT7OpT5","media":null,"username":"g_ray1947","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1274044733539725313","date":1592590909000,"rawContent":"This is what we all need to do. Take the time. Do the work. That's how we'll change things. #BlackLivesMatter #GeorgeFloydProtests #BREONNATAYLOR","media":null,"userna